+# Phase 4C — Comfort Profile — Wiring Notes (non-schema preparation)
+
+Status: preparation only. Nothing in this folder or the shells below is wired
+into routing, storage, or the API. Implementation follows the sequencing in
+`PHASE_4C_COMFORT_PROFILE_CONTRACT_V3.md` §9 (C-1 → C-2 → C-3) and each step
+requires its own review.
+
+## Artifacts in this preparation slice
+
+| Artifact | Path | Wired? |
+|---|---|---|
+| Contract (checksum-verified v3) | `docs/comfort-profile/PHASE_4C_COMFORT_PROFILE_CONTRACT_V3.md` (SHA-256 `339a03e6…`) | n/a |
+| OpenAPI draft | `docs/comfort-profile/openapi.draft.yaml` (`x-status: draft`) | NOT merged into `lib/api-spec/openapi.yaml`; no codegen run |
+| Contract module | `artifacts/api-server/src/contracts/comfort-profile.contract.ts` | imported by contract tests only; dependency-free |
+| Fixtures | `artifacts/api-server/src/__tests__/fixtures/comfort-profile.fixtures.ts` | test-only |
+| Contract tests | `artifacts/api-server/src/__tests__/comfort-profile.contract.test.ts` | `pnpm --filter @workspace/api-server run test:comfort-contract` |
+| Client editor shell | `artifacts/web/src/pages/comfort/comfort-preferences-shell.tsx` | NOT routed |
+| Provider card shell | `artifacts/web/src/components/comfort/provider-comfort-card-shell.tsx` | NOT rendered anywhere |
+
+## C-1 (schema + codegen) — BLOCKED until Gate B + implementation review
+
+- Merge `openapi.draft.yaml` paths/schemas into `lib/api-spec/openapi.yaml`,
+  run `pnpm --filter @workspace/api-spec run codegen` (regenerates
+  `lib/api-zod` + `lib/api-client-react`).
+- Additive tables per contract §5 (`client_comfort_profiles`,
+  `client_comfort_consents`) in `lib/db` — requires the managed Gate B
+  verification with runtime-injected `DATABASE_URL` first.
+
+## C-2 (storage + routes + integration tests)
+
+- Express routes under `artifacts/api-server/src/routes/` implementing the six
+  operations; reuse `buildProviderProjection` and the validators from the
+  contract module so behavior matches the contract tests exactly.
+- Denials on the projection route return `404` (never `403`).
+- No `marketplace_events` emission from any comfort route (contract §3).
+
+## C-3 (web UI wiring)
+
+- Client: route the editor shell (e.g. `/profile/comfort`) from the client
+  profile area; replace shell literals with generated types from
+  `@workspace/api-client-react`; wire grant/withdraw/save/delete callbacks.
+- Provider: render `ProviderComfortCardShell` inside the provider booking
+  detail screen, fed exclusively by `GET /api/bookings/:id/client-comfort`;
+  the card renders nothing when the projection is 404/empty.
+- Optional dismissible post-booking prompt (contract §7.3) — never blocking.
+
+## Locked out of scope (contract §3)
+
+No matching/ranking changes, no analytics/event emission, no mobile work,
+no admin UI, no schema beyond the two additive tables, no care-notes changes.
